Baritone Automate

This mod orchestrates a separately installed Baritone. It does not include
Baritone source or binaries in the published jar.

Baritone is copyright its authors and licensed under the GNU Lesser General
Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0). See https://github.com/cabaletta/baritone.

The file libs/baritone-api-fabric-1.20.0.jar is a local compile-only API jar
built from the Baritone 26.3 branch (commit 25111da). It is not nested into
this mod's release jar. Runtime installs must ship that Baritone build (or a
compatible one) as its own mod.
